      "content": "The Gainsight Bulk API is an asynchronous connector that automates insert or update of large data volumes from CSV files into Gainsight standard and custom objects, with rate limits of 10 calls per hour and 100 per day.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Gainsight Support\n Email: support@gainsight.com",
